1. **Eggs per day**:  
   Claire eats 3 eggs every day.  

2. **Days in 4 weeks**:  
   Each week has 7 days, so 4 weeks = $4 \times 7 = 28$ days.

3. **Total eggs in 4 weeks**:  
   $3 \text{ eggs/day} \times 28 \text{ days} = 84 \text{ eggs}$

4. **Convert to dozens**:  
   1 dozen = 12 eggs  
   $84 \div 12 = 7$ dozens

