### Step 3: Calculate the total number of thorns
Each rose has **8 thorns**, so:

$$
\text{Total thorns} = 75 \text{ roses} \times 8 \text{ thorns per rose} = 600 \text{ thorns}
$$

---

### Final Answer:
$$
\boxed{600}
$$

