But each can is 16 ounces, so 64 ounces divided by 16 ounces per can is 4 cans. So that's the same as before. So 4 cans, each with 3 tomatoes, gives 12 tomatoes. Yep, same answer. So that must be correct. Therefore, the answer is 12 tomatoes.

